{"5175160": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sort The Toys", "steam_appid": 5175160, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sort The Toys</strong> is a cozy organizing simulator where your goal is simple: pick up scattered toys and place them on the correct shelves. Organize thousands of toys, upgrade your skills, and transform a cluttered toy store into a perfectly arranged collection at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5175160/extras/a9e4103560835c6dc2b4d6f6aae3f77a.poster.avif?t=1788202139\" width=1170 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5175160/extras/a9e4103560835c6dc2b4d6f6aae3f77a.webm?t=1788202139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5175160/extras/a9e4103560835c6dc2b4d6f6aae3f77a.mp4?t=1788202139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Relaxing Toy Organization Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thousands of toys have been dropped off, completely mixed up and scattered across the store. Cars, figures, plushies, and many more are waiting to be sorted. It is your job to identify each toy's category, find its designated shelf, and bring complete order back to the shop. No timers. No stress. Just pure organization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5175160/extras/e465b24dd6c0406d99d2ac9c4a3bbff0.poster.avif?t=1788202139\" width=1170 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5175160/extras/e465b24dd6c0406d99d2ac9c4a3bbff0.webm?t=1788202139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5175160/extras/e465b24dd6c0406d99d2ac9c4a3bbff0.mp4?t=1788202139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Over 3,400 Toys to Sort</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over 3.400 toys to pick up and place, every shelf you complete brings you one step closer to full order. Watch the room slowly transform from a chaotic floor into neat, satisfying rows of organized displays.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5175160/extras/fb3f3dea4effc43cfff89d67ccb63e98.poster.avif?t=1788202139\" width=1170 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5175160/extras/fb3f3dea4effc43cfff89d67ccb63e98.webm?t=1788202139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5175160/extras/fb3f3dea4effc43cfff89d67ccb63e98.mp4?t=1788202139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade Your Skills</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you place toys onto shelves, you earn money to spend on useful upgrades:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Passive Upgrades:</strong> Increase your reach distance, expand your carrying capacity, and boost your throwing power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Active Abilities:</strong> Use the <strong>Item Detector</strong> to highlight nearby unsorted toys, activate the <strong>Shelf Locator</strong> to instantly find where a held toy belongs, or use <strong>Telekinesis</strong> to pull distant items straight into your hands.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5175160/extras/03b2f233993421f5fbeea98ef22df9f5.poster.avif?t=1788202139\" width=1170 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5175160/extras/03b2f233993421f5fbeea98ef22df9f5.webm?t=1788202139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5175160/extras/03b2f233993421f5fbeea98ef22df9f5.mp4?t=1788202139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧸 <strong>3,400+ Toys:</strong> Pick up, carry, and organize thousands of distinct items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏪 <strong>Full Store Organization:</strong> Turn a massive mess into a clean, systematically organized shop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💰 Earn money for every correctly sorted toys.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💻 <strong>Skill Progression:</strong> Earn money to unlock and level up skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >☕ <strong>Stress-Free Gameplay:</strong> Play completely at your own pace with no time limits or failure states.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✨ <strong>Satisfying Feedback:</strong> Experience the pure joy of organizing with cozy sound effects and smooth visuals that reward every action.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sort The Toys</strong> is a cozy organizing simulator where your goal is simple: pick up scattered toys and place them on the correct shelves. Organize thousands of toys, upgrade your skills, and transform a cluttered toy store into a perfectly arranged collection at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5175160/extras/a9e4103560835c6dc2b4d6f6aae3f77a.poster.avif?t=1788202139\" width=1170 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5175160/extras/a9e4103560835c6dc2b4d6f6aae3f77a.webm?t=1788202139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5175160/extras/a9e4103560835c6dc2b4d6f6aae3f77a.mp4?t=1788202139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Relaxing Toy Organization Experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thousands of toys have been dropped off, completely mixed up and scattered across the store. Cars, figures, plushies, and many more are waiting to be sorted. It is your job to identify each toy's category, find its designated shelf, and bring complete order back to the shop. No timers. No stress. Just pure organization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5175160/extras/e465b24dd6c0406d99d2ac9c4a3bbff0.poster.avif?t=1788202139\" width=1170 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5175160/extras/e465b24dd6c0406d99d2ac9c4a3bbff0.webm?t=1788202139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5175160/extras/e465b24dd6c0406d99d2ac9c4a3bbff0.mp4?t=1788202139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Over 3,400 Toys to Sort</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over 3.400 toys to pick up and place, every shelf you complete brings you one step closer to full order. Watch the room slowly transform from a chaotic floor into neat, satisfying rows of organized displays.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5175160/extras/fb3f3dea4effc43cfff89d67ccb63e98.poster.avif?t=1788202139\" width=1170 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5175160/extras/fb3f3dea4effc43cfff89d67ccb63e98.webm?t=1788202139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5175160/extras/fb3f3dea4effc43cfff89d67ccb63e98.mp4?t=1788202139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade Your Skills</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you place toys onto shelves, you earn money to spend on useful upgrades:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Passive Upgrades:</strong> Increase your reach distance, expand your carrying capacity, and boost your throwing power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Active Abilities:</strong> Use the <strong>Item Detector</strong> to highlight nearby unsorted toys, activate the <strong>Shelf Locator</strong> to instantly find where a held toy belongs, or use <strong>Telekinesis</strong> to pull distant items straight into your hands.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5175160/extras/03b2f233993421f5fbeea98ef22df9f5.poster.avif?t=1788202139\" width=1170 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5175160/extras/03b2f233993421f5fbeea98ef22df9f5.webm?t=1788202139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5175160/extras/03b2f233993421f5fbeea98ef22df9f5.mp4?t=1788202139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragrap